{
    "title": "FamilyWall: Family Organizer",
    "description": "FamilyWall: a game changer for families! Revolutionize the way you organize and connect with your loved ones. From shared calendars to collaborative lists, document sharing to finance tracking, meal planning to secure messaging\u2014it's your all-in-one solution for a seamlessly coordinated family life. \r\n\r\nWith FamilyWall, you can spend more time doing what you love, and less time organizing it. The whole family can easily access FamilyWall with a smartphone, a tablet or any web browser.\r\n\r\nExperience the difference with FamilyWall!\r\n\r\n<u>FREE FEATURES</u>\r\n\r\n<b>SHARED FAMILY CALENDAR</b>\r\n\u2022 Use the color-coded calendar to view an individual's schedule, or the whole family at once\r\n\u2022 Set reminders so no one misses soccer practice or an important event\r\n\u2022 Import your current calendars with a single touch (Outlook/Google)\r\n\r\n<b>SHOPPING LISTS</b>\r\n\u2022 Share grocery and shopping lists with the whole family\r\n\u2022 Browse your lists even when you\u2019re offline at the store and quickly check items while you shop\r\n\u2022 See items added by other family members. Never forget the almond milk again!\r\n\r\n<b>TASK LISTS</b>\r\n\u2022 Create a private or shared to-do list, wish list or chore checklist for kids\r\n\u2022 Assign to-dos to selected family members\r\n\u2022 Create different lists including packing lists, the kids\u2019 camp list, emergency supplies and more\r\n\r\n<b>RECIPES</b>\r\n\u2022 Store and share your favorite recipes\r\n\u2022 Easily import recipes from the Web\r\n\r\n<b>FAMILY MESSAGING</b>\r\nPost short messages to one or several family members who will in turn be notified.\r\n\r\n<b>FAMILY GALLERY</b>\r\nShare your best moments with your family and friends in a simple and private way.\r\n\r\n<b>IMPORTANT CONTACTS</b>\r\nUse the Family Directory to rapidly find useful contacts (e.g. babysitter, grandparents\u2026).\r\n\r\n<u>FAMILYWALL PREMIUM PLAN</u>\r\n\r\nIn addition to the free features, some exclusive features are available with FamilyWall Premium. You may subscribe to the Premium Plan at any time and enjoy the following benefits:\r\n\r\n<b>BUDGET</b>\r\n\u2022 Track your Family expenses\r\n\u2022 Set spending limits per categories\r\n\r\n<b>MEAL PLANNER</b>\r\n\u2022 Plan your meals ahead for the week\r\n\u2022 Import your ingredients in your shopping list in one click\r\n\r\n<b>FAMILY DOCUMENTS</b>\r\n\u2022 Store and share important Family documents\r\n\u2022 Create private or shared folders to better manage your documents\r\n\r\n<b>SCHEDULES</b>\r\n\u2022 Manage your different schedules (recurring or not)\r\n\u2022 Easily import schedules from universities or school via Url\r\n\r\n<b>ADVANCED CALENDAR FEATURES</b>\r\n\u2022 Google & Outook Calendar Sync\r\n\u2022 Subscribe to any public or shared calendar via its URL\r\n\r\n<b>LOCATOR</b>\r\n\u2022 Locate family members and receive notifications for arrivals and departures\r\n\r\n<b>AND MORE\u2026</b>\r\n\u2022 Benefit from 25 GB Storage\r\n\u2022 Enjoy audio and video messaging\r\n\r\nAfter the Free 30 day trial, the Premium offer is charged on a subscription basis for 4.99 USD / month or 44.99 USD / Year (for the US and Canada). For the rest of the world, please refer to the price automatically prompted to you by the application. Payment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. Subscriptions may be managed by you and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to your user's Account Settings after purchase. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable. The Premium Plan features are applied to the first 5 circles created.\r\n\r\nTERMS OF USE: https://www.familywall.com/terms.html\r\nPRIVACY POLICY: https://www.familywall.com/privacy.html\r\n\r\nWe love feedback. Please send us suggestions, must-have features or any request at support@familyandco.com.\r\n\r\nEnjoy!\r\nFamilyWall Team - \u2665",
    "descriptionHTML": "FamilyWall: a game changer for families! Revolutionize the way you organize and connect with your loved ones. From shared calendars to collaborative lists, document sharing to finance tracking, meal planning to secure messaging\u2014it&#39;s your all-in-one solution for a seamlessly coordinated family life. <br><br>With FamilyWall, you can spend more time doing what you love, and less time organizing it. The whole family can easily access FamilyWall with a smartphone, a tablet or any web browser.<br><br>Experience the difference with FamilyWall!<br><br><u>FREE FEATURES</u><br><br><b>SHARED FAMILY CALENDAR</b><br>\u2022 Use the color-coded calendar to view an individual&#39;s schedule, or the whole family at once<br>\u2022 Set reminders so no one misses soccer practice or an important event<br>\u2022 Import your current calendars with a single touch (Outlook/Google)<br><br><b>SHOPPING LISTS</b><br>\u2022 Share grocery and shopping lists with the whole family<br>\u2022 Browse your lists even when you\u2019re offline at the store and quickly check items while you shop<br>\u2022 See items added by other family members. Never forget the almond milk again!<br><br><b>TASK LISTS</b><br>\u2022 Create a private or shared to-do list, wish list or chore checklist for kids<br>\u2022 Assign to-dos to selected family members<br>\u2022 Create different lists including packing lists, the kids\u2019 camp list, emergency supplies and more<br><br><b>RECIPES</b><br>\u2022 Store and share your favorite recipes<br>\u2022 Easily import recipes from the Web<br><br><b>FAMILY MESSAGING</b><br>Post short messages to one or several family members who will in turn be notified.<br><br><b>FAMILY GALLERY</b><br>Share your best moments with your family and friends in a simple and private way.<br><br><b>IMPORTANT CONTACTS</b><br>Use the Family Directory to rapidly find useful contacts (e.g. babysitter, grandparents\u2026).<br><br><u>FAMILYWALL PREMIUM PLAN</u><br><br>In addition to the free features, some exclusive features are available with FamilyWall Premium. You may subscribe to the Premium Plan at any time and enjoy the following benefits:<br><br><b>BUDGET</b><br>\u2022 Track your Family expenses<br>\u2022 Set spending limits per categories<br><br><b>MEAL PLANNER</b><br>\u2022 Plan your meals ahead for the week<br>\u2022 Import your ingredients in your shopping list in one click<br><br><b>FAMILY DOCUMENTS</b><br>\u2022 Store and share important Family documents<br>\u2022 Create private or shared folders to better manage your documents<br><br><b>SCHEDULES</b><br>\u2022 Manage your different schedules (recurring or not)<br>\u2022 Easily import schedules from universities or school via Url<br><br><b>ADVANCED CALENDAR FEATURES</b><br>\u2022 Google &amp; Outook Calendar Sync<br>\u2022 Subscribe to any public or shared calendar via its URL<br><br><b>LOCATOR</b><br>\u2022 Locate family members and receive notifications for arrivals and departures<br><br><b>AND MORE\u2026</b><br>\u2022 Benefit from 25 GB Storage<br>\u2022 Enjoy audio and video messaging<br><br>After the Free 30 day trial, the Premium offer is charged on a subscription basis for 4.99 USD / month or 44.99 USD / Year (for the US and Canada). For the rest of the world, please refer to the price automatically prompted to you by the application. Payment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase. Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period. Subscriptions may be managed by you and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to your user&#39;s Account Settings after purchase. Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable. The Premium Plan features are applied to the first 5 circles created.<br><br>TERMS OF USE: https://www.familywall.com/terms.html<br>PRIVACY POLICY: https://www.familywall.com/privacy.html<br><br>We love feedback. Please send us suggestions, must-have features or any request at support@familyandco.com.<br><br>Enjoy!<br>FamilyWall Team - \u2665",
